  "intro": {
    "text": "The present takes *-Yn, -sYň, —, -Ys, -sYňYz, -lAr* (*gelýärin*); the past takes *-m, -ň, —, -k, -ňYz, -lAr* (*geldim*). New: *bolmak*, to be, become or happen: *Näme boldy?* (What happened?)",
    "see": "gp-person-endings-types"
  },
  "vocab": [
    { "tk": "bolmak", "en": "to be; to become; to happen", "pos": "verb", "card": "fc-0002" },
